    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">1.	Support for the AU Commission&apos;s involvement in the G20: The Minister noted the importance of clarifying the division of responsibilities between the Commission and the Presidency for G20 representation. He committed to providing more details on this matter in the coming weeks.
2.	Support for the Mauritania Presidency across four key areas: We discussed support in the areas of climate/environment, debt management, financial architecture/IFIs, and communication. We believe we&apos;re well-positioned to provide expertise in these domains</narrative>
